WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.981 --> 00:00:01.835
- There's a spot.

00:00:01.865 --> 00:00:02.891
- Naw, I couldn't fit in there.

00:00:02.891 --> 00:00:04.175
It's way too tight, that one.

00:00:04.175 --> 00:00:06.251
- No, you can make it, you're
a great parallel parker.

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:08.456
(ominous music)
- [Voiceover] Oh fuck!

00:00:08.456 --> 00:00:09.811
(heavy bell chimes)

00:00:12.891 --> 00:00:13.882
- [Waiter] And what can
I get for you today?

00:00:13.882 --> 00:00:15.718
- [Woman] I'll have the brussel
sprout and fried egg salad.

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:16.825
- Excellent and for you sir?

00:00:16.825 --> 00:00:18.444
- I'll have the swordfish.

00:00:18.444 --> 00:00:20.482
- [Waiter] We actually just
ran out of the swordfish.

00:00:20.482 --> 00:00:21.996
Is there something else I can get for you?

00:00:21.996 --> 00:00:22.726
(ominous music)

00:00:22.726 --> 00:00:24.395
- [Internal monologue] Yeah,
yeah, find something ...

00:00:24.395 --> 00:00:25.941
I'll find something, steak, red meat,

00:00:25.941 --> 00:00:28.072
can't do red meat, too much
cholesterol, I'm watching that.

00:00:28.072 --> 00:00:30.079
I need fish, fish, fish,
fish, fish, fish, fish.

00:00:30.079 --> 00:00:32.055
Find something, oh dear
God, help me find something.

00:00:32.055 --> 00:00:34.126
Help me! Help me! Help me!

00:00:34.126 --> 00:00:36.110
(light piano music)
- (blowing sigh)

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.003
(women chatting)

00:00:40.316 --> 00:00:41.346
- Hey!

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:43.890
(woman laughs)

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:45.235
- [Internal Monologue] Oh my God!

00:00:45.235 --> 00:00:46.449
They're laughing at me!

00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:47.565
- I'm trying, I can't...
(horn honking)

00:00:47.565 --> 00:00:48.357
the machine's broke.
(horn honking angrily)

00:00:48.357 --> 00:00:49.564
It's not taking it.
(multiple horns honking)

00:00:49.564 --> 00:00:52.223
It's not taking it, it's not
my fault it's not taking it!

00:00:52.223 --> 00:00:53.281
(ominous music)

00:00:53.281 --> 00:00:55.165
- Oh you know what, this
is not what I ordered.

00:00:55.165 --> 00:00:56.772
Do you mind getting
the waiter's attention?

00:00:56.772 --> 00:00:58.433
(panicked music)

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.920
- [Woman] Hey, Andy, um boss says

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.188
she's looking for you, so...

00:01:01.219 --> 00:01:02.532
(ominous music)

00:01:02.532 --> 00:01:04.744
(sniffles)
(metal tap clicks)

00:01:04.744 --> 00:01:05.836
(panicked music)

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:07.109
- How much you wanna leave for a tip?

00:01:07.109 --> 00:01:08.262
(panicked music)

00:01:08.497 --> 00:01:09.743
(phone vibration)

00:01:09.821 --> 00:01:13.758
(ominous music)

00:01:13.758 --> 00:01:14.843
- Mmepphh

00:01:14.843 --> 00:01:15.953
- Yeah, I was reading this weekend

00:01:15.953 --> 00:01:18.375
that if California keeps
up in this drought,

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.190
two years we'll be out of water.

00:01:21.858 --> 00:01:24.020
- It's the price we pay
for living in a desert.

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.143
- Yeah.

00:01:26.582 --> 00:01:27.589
Oh, your fly's open.

00:01:27.589 --> 00:01:29.096
(panicked music)

